# Book: Tests/Bugs/FORT-555217-VeryLongIdentifier.versetest:25 (bp_vm_only):
# a class whose name has 1024 characters (the Book's own name; its field has
# 992). The Book's Blueprint VM refuses it at link time, 9002 (an Unreal
# name holds at most 1023); no Verse VM twin. OpenVerse has no limit on a
# name's length: it admits it and prints
#   field 42
# If UEFN 43.12 refuses it (Build Verse Scripts, or the cook of a Verse VM
# session), Epic's shipped toolchain refuses a program OpenVerse runs.
# Control: long-ident-class-1024-control (960 characters, the Book's valid
# class). Run it alone (single mode), not in a batch: Epic's names for it
# may depend on the module that holds it.
# Epic's compiler (UEFN 43.12, ++Fortnite+Release-43.12-CL-60598086,
# BuildAll, 2026-11-19) refuses it: 9002 (L11) "Cannot find class: `Class___
# AbcdefghAbcdefghAbcdefghAbcdefghAbcdefghAbcdefghAbcdefghAbcdefghAbcdefghAb
# cdefghAbcdefghAbcdefghAbcdefghAbcdefghAbcdefghAbcdefghAbcd".
Class___ := class:
    Var_____:int = 42
    F(P:int):int = P

Main():void =
    Obj := Class___{}
    Print("OVPROBE field {Obj.Var_____}")
